{"id":"ola","lemma":"ola","pos":"noun","rank":2897,"glosses":["wave (on the surface of a liquid)","sudden appearance of a large amount of something","Mexican wave"],"ipa":"/ˈola/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"olas"},"order":2902,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ola.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es divertido jugar en las olas.","en":"Waves are fun to play in.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850331","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"entertaining"},{"g":"to play"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Las olas son enormes.","en":"The waves are enormous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604505","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"enormous, huge","l":"enorme"}]},{"text":"Las olas están hoy altas.","en":"The waves are high today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599005","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"today, tonight"},{"g":"tall","l":"alto"}]}]}